---
import me3 from '../assets/me3.png';
---

<section id="about" class="bg-slate-900 py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16">

    <div class="w-full md:w-2/5 fade-up">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500/20 to-violet-500/20 rounded-2xl blur-xl"></div>
        <img
          src={me3.src}
          alt="Francisco Sanabria at Hacktoberfest"
          class="relative rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full object-cover border border-slate-700"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full md:w-3/5 fade-up">
      <p class="text-indigo-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">About me</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Building software that makes a difference</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-justify">
        <p>
          I'm a Senior Mobile Developer based in Paraguay with 4+ years of experience building fintech and enterprise mobile applications. I specialize in Flutter and clean architecture, focused on shipping maintainable, production-grade software at scale.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've spent most of my career at <strong class="text-slate-300">e-tica</strong>, working on <strong class="text-slate-300">EKO and Banco Familiar</strong> — real-world banking apps used by thousands of users. I've grown from implementing features (30% fraud reduction, 2h → 5min identity lookups) to serving as <strong class="text-slate-300">TL Backup</strong>, standardizing mobile practices across squads. In between, I worked as <strong class="text-slate-300">Mobile Architect at itti</strong>, Paraguay's leading tech company, building KYC SDKs and driving clean architecture adoption across the mobile team.
        </p>
        <p>
          Beyond my day job, I co-founded the <strong class="text-slate-300">IEEE Computer Science Society</strong> at Universidad Nacional de Asunción and served as its inaugural president. I'm passionate about open source, mentorship, and building things that last.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {["Flutter", "Dart", "Clean Architecture", "Fintech", "CI/CD", "Team Leadership"].map(tag => (
          <span class="bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{tag}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
